### MODEL (turn 2)
The bug is in `balance_sheet`: income and expense are summed in debit-positive form, so `income + expense` gives the negative of profit, and adding it to equity subtracts profit instead of adding it. I'll fix the sign and rerun the tests.
[tool call luau]
