### MODEL (turn 3)
The balance sheet bug was a sign error in `balance_sheet` in `ledger/reports.py`: retained earnings were computed as `income + expense` in debit-positive form, which is the negative of profit, so profit was subtracted from equity instead of added. I changed it to `-(income + expense)`, and all three tests now pass.
